msgstr "本地日志记录"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/usage/usage_stats_collection.rst:145
msgid ""
"If you would like to log to a file in addition to (or instead of) sending"
" data to the server, pass a local-log path when initializing:"
msgstr "如果您希望在将数据发送到服务器的同时（或替代）记录到文件中，请在初始化时传递一个本地日志路径："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/usage/usage_stats_collection.rst:157
msgid ""
"Omitting the ``local_log`` argument (or passing ``None``) disables local "
"file logging."
msgstr "省略 ``local_log`` 参数（或传递 ``None``\\ ）将禁用本地文件日志记录。"

